# /etc/fstab - UbixOS static mount table
#
# device       mountpoint   fstype    options
none           /dev         devfs     defaults
none           /proc        procfs    defaults
# The FAT boot partition is discovered + mounted at /boot automatically by
# automountd (it enumerates the MBR via ubix_disk_query — no hardcoded, per-arch
# device name), so there is no static line for it here.  (The kernel also
# pre-mounts /boot early for the self-rebuild loop; automountd skips it if so.)
